---
import MainLayout from '../../layouts/MainLayout.astro';

const personSchema = {
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "Person",
  "name": "Mizanur Rahaman",
  "jobTitle": "Frontend Developer & Founder",
  "url": "https://pixelquil.com/about/",
  "worksFor": {
    "@type": "Organization",
    "name": "Pixelquil"
  },
  "knowsAbout": ["SVG", "Frontend Development", "Shopify Development", "Technical SEO", "JavaScript", "CSS"],
  "nationality": "Bangladeshi"
};
---

<MainLayout
  title="About"
  description="Meet the developer behind Pixelquil, a privacy-first toolkit for SVG, frontend, and technical SEO work, built from real production experience."
>
  <script type="application/ld+json" set:html={JSON.stringify(personSchema)} />

  <section class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 py-20">
    <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-full bg-brand-50 px-3 py-1 text-xs font-medium text-brand-600">
      About Pixelquil
    </span>

    <h1 class="mt-6 text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900 sm:text-5xl">
      Built by someone who actually uses these tools
    </h1>

    <p class="mt-6 text-lg text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
      Pixelquil is built and maintained by Mizanur Rahaman, a frontend developer based in Bangladesh
      with over 5 years of hands-on experience building live, production websites, not just design
      mockups. Every tool on this site exists because it solved a real problem in real client work
      first.
    </p>

    <div class="mt-10 flex items-center gap-4 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-6">
      <div class="flex h-16 w-16 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-brand-100 text-2xl font-bold text-brand-600">
        MR
      </div>
      <div>
        <p class="font-semibold text-slate-900">Mizanur Rahaman</p>
        <p class="text-sm text-slate-500">Frontend Developer, Bangladesh</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <h2 class="mt-12 text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900">Why Pixelquil exists</h2>
    <p class="mt-4 text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
      Over years of turning Figma and design files into fully functional, pixel-accurate live
      websites, the same small technical problems kept coming up: SVG exports with broken viewBox
      attributes, icons that needed quick recoloring, config files that needed converting, technical
      SEO checks that needed a fast answer without opening a full audit suite. Most existing tools
      for these tasks were either buried in ads, required a signup, or quietly uploaded files to a
      server with no clear privacy policy. Pixelquil is the toolkit built to fix that: fast, free,
      and everything runs in your browser.
    </p>

    <h2 class="mt-12 text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900">Real experience, not just theory</h2>
    <p class="mt-4 text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
      Every tool on this site is grounded in production work, not written from a textbook. Building
      hundreds of Shopify storefronts and custom frontend projects means translating Figma designs
      into pixel-accurate HTML, CSS, and JavaScript, optimizing conversion-focused landing pages, and
      fixing the exact SVG and technical SEO issues that Pixelquil's tools now solve directly. That
      hands-on background is also why every tool page on this site includes real, specific written
      guidance, not generic filler, alongside the tool itself.
    </p>

    <h2 class="mt-12 text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900">What Pixelquil stands for</h2>
    <ul class="mt-4 space-y-3 text-slate-600">
      <li class="flex gap-3">
        <svg class="mt-1 h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-brand-600" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M3 8l3.5 3.5L13 5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
        <span><strong class="text-slate-900">Privacy by default.</strong> Every tool runs entirely in your browser. Nothing you paste or upload is sent to a server.</span>
      </li>
      <li class="flex gap-3">
        <svg class="mt-1 h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-brand-600" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M3 8l3.5 3.5L13 5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
        <span><strong class="text-slate-900">No signup for core tools.</strong> Open a tool and use it immediately.</span>
      </li>
      <li class="flex gap-3">
        <svg class="mt-1 h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-brand-600" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M3 8l3.5 3.5L13 5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
        <span><strong class="text-slate-900">Real written guidance, not filler.</strong> Every tool page includes genuine explanation grounded in actual production experience, not generic AI padding.</span>
      </li>
    </ul>

    <div class="mt-12 rounded-2xl bg-brand-50 p-6">
      <p class="text-sm text-slate-600">
        Have feedback, found a bug, or want to suggest a tool? Reach out through the
        <a href="/contact/" class="font-medium text-brand-600 hover:underline">contact page</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</MainLayout>